<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="07">
<name>Steering</name>
<section id="1000U_S0017" variety="S0017">
<name>Steering Column</name>
<ttl id="1000U_S0017_746I2_T00CG" variety="T00CG">
<name>Steering Lock System</name>
<para id="RM0000005FQ00UX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="480YF-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM0000005FQ00UX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A0T00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] Communication Function</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>On the SST (TaSCAN) screen, select [Diagnosis] → [Vehicle Diagnosis/ALL Diag] or [System Diagnosis/Body], and check the diagnostic trouble codes for [System Name/Certification ECU]. (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM0000005GM00UX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result:</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.90in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.23in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abnormal diagnostic trouble code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If an abnormal code is output, inspect the large-scale body multiplex communication system (LIN). (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000001Z23006X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Body Multiplex Communication (LIN) Section</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check and record the diagnostic trouble codes. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000005GM00UX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result:</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.92in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.21in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTCs normal,</ptxt>
<ptxt>Problem symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTCs normal,</ptxt>
<ptxt>Problem symptom cannot be confirmed or reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abnormal diagnostic trouble code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When a diagnostic trouble code is output, refer to the Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart. (see <xref label="Seep05" href="RM0000005GI00VX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The steering lock system does not store past diagnostic trouble codes.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the DTCs are normal and the problem symptom cannot be confirmed or reproduced, perform "Problem Simulation". (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Perform Problem Simulation</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 7</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check whether the problem symptom matches an item in the List by Symptom. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000URR00HX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result:</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.94in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.19in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Does not match an item in the List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Matches an item in the List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 7</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the methods below based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM0000005GN00VX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM0000005GJ00VX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>